_id\nstatus, goal\ncost_usd","fontSize":16}},{"type":"rectangle","id":"e4","x":2970,"y":360,"width":240,"height":140,"roughness":0,"backgroundColor":"#b2f2bb","fillStyle":"solid","label":{"text":"MEMORY_ITEM\nid, tenant_id\nagent_id (FK)\ncontent\nttl","fontSize":16}},{"type":"rectangle","id":"e5","x":3320,"y":360,"width":240,"height":140,"roughness":0,"backgroundColor":"#d0bfff","fillStyle":"solid","label":{"text":"AGENT\nid, tenant_id\nname, version\nmodel_policy\nallowed_tools","fontSize":16}},{"type":"rectangle","id":"e6","x":3670,"y":360,"width":240,"height":140,"roughness":0,"backgroundColor":"#ffec99","fillStyle":"solid","label":{"text":"STEP\nid, run_id (FK)\nseq, type\nstatus\ntokens","fontSize":16}},{"type":"rectangle","id":"e7","x":3670,"y":600,"width":240,"height":140,"roughness":0,"backgroundColor":"#ffec99","fillStyle":"solid","label":{"text":"TOOL_CALL\nid, step_id (FK)\ntool, args_hash\nidempotency_key\nresult_ref","fontSize":16}},{"type":"rectangle","id":"e8","x":3320,"y":600,"width":240,"height":140,"roughness":0,"backgroundColor":"#ffc9c9","fillStyle":"solid","label":{"text":"APPROVAL\nid\ntool_call_id (FK)\napprover_id\ndecision, at","fontSize":16}},{"type":"arrow","id":"ea1","x":3210,"y":190,"points":[[0,0],[110,0]],"endArrowhead":null},{"type":"text","id":"el1","x":3243,"y":166,"text":"1 : N","fontSize":16},{"type":"arrow","id":"ea2","x":3560,"y":190,"points":[[0,0],[110,0]],"endArrowhead":null},{"type":"text","id":"el2","x":3593,"y":166,"text":"1 : N","fontSize":16},{"type":"arrow","id":"ea3","x":3560,"y":390,"points":[[0,0],[110,-150]],"endArrowhead":null},{"type":"text","id":"el3","x":3566,"y":290,"text":"1 : N","fontSize":16},{"type":"arrow","id":"ea4","x":3320,"y":430,"points":[[0,0],[-110,0]],"endArrowhead":null},{"type":"text","id":"el4","x":3243,"y":406,"text":"1 : N","fontSize":16},{"type":"arrow","id":"ea5","x":3790,"y":260,"points":[[0,0],[0,100]],"endArrowhead":null},{"type":"text","id":"el5","x":3802,"y":300,"text":"1 : N","fontSize":16},{"type":"arrow","id":"ea6","x":3790,"y":500,"points":[[0,0],[0,100]],"endArrowhead":null},{"type":"text","id":"el6","x":3802,"y":540,"text":"1 : N","fontSize":16},{"type":"arrow","id":"ea7","x":3670,"y":670,"points":[[0,0],[-110,0]],"endArrowhead":null},{"type":"text","id":"el7","x":3586,"y":646,"text":"1 : 0..1","fontSize":16},{"type":"text","id":"f2n","x":2970,"y":780,"text":"State DB holds these tables; embeddings live in the vector index.","fontSize":16},{"type":"frame","id":"F2","name":"2. Data model","x":2940,"y":0,"width":1000,"height":840,"children":["f2h","f2s","e1","e2","e3","e4","e5","e6","e7","e8","ea1","el1","ea2","el2","ea3","el3","ea4","el4","ea5","el5","ea6","el6","ea7","el7","f2n"]},{"type":"text","id":"f3h","x":4050,"y":24,"text":"3. API contract","fontSize":28},{"type":"text","id":"f3s","x":4050,"y":66,"text":"Runs are asynchronous: create, stream events, approve","fontSize":16},{"type":"rectangle","id":"p0","x":4050,"y":110,"width":940,"height":290,"roughness":0},{"type":"text","id":"p1","x":4070,"y":130,"text":"Endpoint\n\nPOST /v1/runs\n\nGET  /v1/runs/{id}\n\nGET  /v1/runs/{id}/events\n\nPOST /v1/runs/{id}/cancel\n\nPOST /v1/approvals/{id}\n\nGET  /v1/tools","fontSize":16},{"type":"text","id":"p2","x":4400,"y":130,"text":"Purpose\n\nStart a run (returns 202)\n\nStatus, result, cost\n\nLive step stream (SSE)\n\nStop a run\n\nApprove or reject an action\n\nTools this caller may use","fontSize":16},{"type":"text","id":"p3","x":4750,"y":130,"text":"Scope\n\nruns:write\n\nruns:read\n\nruns:read\n\nruns:write\n\napprovals:write\n\ntools:read","fontSize":16},{"type":"rectangle","id":"p4","x":4050,"y":430,"width":455,"height":220,"roughness":0,"backgroundColor":"#e9ecef","fillStyle":"solid"},{"type":"text","id":"p5","x":4070,"y":450,"text":"Request: POST /v1/runs\nIdempotency-Key: 7f3a...\n\n{\n  \"agent_id\": \"agt_invoice\",\n  \"goal\": \"Reconcile March invoices\",\n  \"max_cost_usd\": 2.00\n}","fontSize":16},{"type":"rectangle","id":"p6","x":4535,"y":430,"width":455,"height":220,"roughness":0,"backgroundColor":"#e9ecef","fillStyle":"solid"},{"type":"text","id":"p7","x":4555,"y":450,"text":"Response: 202 Accepted\n\n{\n  \"run_id\": \"run_91c2\",\n  \"status\": \"queued\",\n  \"events_url\":\n    \"/v1/runs/run_91c2/events\"\n}","fontSize":16},{"type":"text","id":"p8","x":4050,"y":680,"text":"Auth: OAuth 2.0 bearer token; tenant comes from the token, never the body\nStatuses: queued, running, awaiting_approval, succeeded, failed, cancelled\nErrors: 400 invalid, 401 / 403 auth, 409 idempotency conflict,\n422 blocked by guardrail, 429 quota (with Retry-After)","fontSize":16},{"type":"frame","id":"F3","name":"3. API contract","x":4020,"y":0,"width":1000,"height":840,"children":["f3h","f3s","p0","p1","p2","p3","p4","p5","p6","p7","p8"]},{"type":"text","id":"f4h","x":1890,"y":944,"text":"4. Security and guardrails","fontSize":28},{"type":"text","id":"f4s","x":1890,"y":986,"text":"Six checkpoints; if a check cannot run, the action is blocked","fontSize":16},{"type":"rectangle","id":"s1","x":1890,"y":1030,"width":940,"height":80,"roughness":0,"backgroundColor":"#ffc9c9","fillStyle":"solid","label":{"text":"1. Identity: SSO (OIDC), RBAC, per-tenant quotas, mTLS between services","fontSize":16}},{"type":"rectangle","id":"s2","x":1890,"y":1126,"width":940,"height":80,"roughness":0,"backgroundColor":"#ffc9c9","fillStyle":"solid","label":{"text":"2. Input: prompt injection detection, PII redaction, size limits","fontSize":16}},{"type":"rectangle","id":"s3","x":1890,"y":1222,"width":940,"height":80,"roughness":0,"backgroundColor":"#ffc9c9","fillStyle":"solid","label":{"text":"3. Context: retrieval filtered by user permissions; documents treated as untrusted","fontSize":16}},{"type":"rectangle","id":"s4","x":1890,"y":1318,"width":940,"height":80,"roughness":0,"backgroundColor":"#ffc9c9","fillStyle":"solid","label":{"text":"4. Action: tool allowlist, short-lived scoped credentials, sandboxed code,\nhuman approval for writes, payments and deletes","fontSize":16}},{"type":"rectangle","id":"s5","x":1890,"y":1414,"width":940,"height":80,"roughness":0,"backgroundColor":"#ffc9c9","fillStyle":"solid","label":{"text":"5. Output: data leak scan, policy filter, schema validation, citations","fontSize":16}},{"type":"rectangle","id":"s6","x":1890,"y":1510,"width":940,"height":80,"roughness":0,"backgroundColor":"#ffc9c9","fillStyle":"solid","label":{"text":"6. Audit: append-only log of prompts, tool calls and approvals, kept 1 year","fontSize":16}},{"type":"text","id":"s7","x":1890,"y":1625,"text":"Data: AES-256 at rest, TLS 1.3 in transit, secrets in a vault, tenant isolation on every query.\nModels: providers contracted not to train on tenant data.","fontSize":16},{"type":"frame","id":"F4","name":"4. Security and guardrails","x":1860,"y":920,"width":1000,"height":840,"children":["f4h","f4s","s1","s2","s3","s4","s5","s6","s7"]},{"type":"text","id":"f5h","x":2970,"y":944,"text":"5. Deployment","fontSize":28},{"type":"text","id":"f5s","x":2970,"y":986,"text":"Stateless services on Kubernetes across 3 zones; state is managed","fontSize":16},{"type":"rectangle","id":"d1","x":3190,"y":1030,"width":500,"height":60,"roughness":0,"backgroundColor":"#a5d8ff","fillStyle":"solid","label":{"text":"Edge: WAF + load balancer","fontSize":16}},{"type":"rectangle","id":"d2","x":2970,"y":1140,"width":940,"height":220,"roughness":0,"strokeStyle":"dashed"},{"type":"text","id":"d2t","x":2990,"y":1155,"text":"Kubernetes cluster (private subnets)","fontSize":16},{"type":"rectangle","id":"d3","x":2990,"y":1200,"width":280,"height":130,"roughness":0,"backgroundColor":"#a5d8ff","fillStyle":"solid","label":{"text":"gateways\nAPI, tool, model router\n3+ replicas","fontSize":16}},{"type":"rectangle","id":"d4","x":3300,"y":1200,"width":280,"height":130,"roughness":0,"backgroundColor":"#ffec99","fillStyle":"solid","label":{"text":"control\norchestrator, guardrails,\napprovals, 3+ replicas","fontSize":16}},{"type":"rectangle","id":"d5","x":3610,"y":1200,"width":280,"height":130,"roughness":0,"backgroundColor":"#d0bfff","fillStyle":"solid","label":{"text":"agents\nplanner and workers\nautoscale on queue depth","fontSize":16}},{"type":"rectangle","id":"d6","x":2970,"y":1420,"width":940,"height":150,"roughness":0,"strokeStyle":"dashed"},{"type":"text","id":"d6t","x":2990,"y":1435,"text":"Managed data (multi-zone, encrypted)","fontSize":16},{"type":"ellipse","id":"d7","x":2990,"y":1470,"width":210,"height":80,"roughness":0,"backgroundColor":"#b2f2bb","fillStyle":"solid","label":{"text":"Postgres","fontSize":16}},{"type":"ellipse","id":"d8","x":3220,"y":1470,"width":210,"height":80,"roughness":0,"backgroundColor":"#b2f2bb","fillStyle":"solid","label":{"text":"Vector DB","fontSize":16}},{"type":"ellipse","id":"d9","x":3450,"y":1470,"width":210,"height":80,"roughness":0,"backgroundColor":"#b2f2bb","fillStyle":"solid","label":{"text":"Queue","fontSize":16}},{"type":"ellipse","id":"d10","x":3680,"y":1470,"width":210,"height":80,"roughness":0,"backgroundColor":"#b2f2bb","fillStyle":"solid","label":{"text":"Object store","fontSize":16}},{"type":"arrow","id":"da1","x":3440,"y":1090,"points":[[0,0],[0,50]]},{"type":"arrow","id":"da2","x":3440,"y":1360,"points":[[0,0],[0,60]]},{"type":"text","id":"d11","x":2970,"y":1600,"text":"Release: dev -> staging (eval suite must pass) -> prod canary 5% -> 100%\nRollback automatically if error rate or eval score regresses.\nInfrastructure as code; warm standby in a second region.","fontSize":16},{"type":"frame","id":"F5","name":"5. Deployment","x":2940,"y":920,"width":1000,"height":840,"children":["f5h","f5s","d1","d2","d2t","d3","d4","d5","d6","d6t","d7","d8","d9","d10","da1","da2","d11"]},{"type":"text","id":"f6h","x":4050,"y":944,"text":"6. Non-functional requirements","fontSize":28},{"type":"text","id":"f6s","x":4050,"y":986,"text":"Reliable, fast to respond and cost-capped (proposed targets)","fontSize":16},{"type":"rectangle","id":"n0","x":4050,"y":1030,"width":940,"height":450,"roughness":0},{"type":"text","id":"n1","x":4070,"y":1050,"text":"Quality\n\nAvailability\n\nGateway latency\n\nFirst event\n\nScale\n\nDurability\n\nRecovery\n\nCost\n\nAgent quality\n\nCompliance\n\nTraceability","fontSize":16},{"type":"text","id":"n2","x":4280,"y":1050,"text":"Target\n\n99.9% monthly\n\np95 under 200 ms (excl. models)\n\np95 under 3 s\n\n1,000 concurrent runs\n\nNo accepted run lost\n\nRPO 5 min, RTO 30 min\n\n$2 default cap per run\n\n90% or more task success\n\nSOC 2, GDPR, data residency\n\n100% of runs traced","fontSize":16},{"type":"text","id":"n3","x":4660,"y":1050,"text":"Measured by\n\nUptime probes\n\nGateway metrics\n\nRun traces\n\nLoad test\n\nCheckpoint replay\n\nFailover drill\n\nCost meter\n\nEval suite\n\nAnnual audit\n\nTrace coverage","fontSize":16},{"type":"frame","id":"F6","name":"6. Non-functional requirements","x":4020,"y":920,"width":1000,"height":840,"children":["f6h","f6s","n0","n1","n2","n3"]}]},{"turn":3,"op":"add","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"pT","x":0,"y":1860,"text":"Atlas client presentation","fontSize":32},{"type":"rectangle","id":"c_bar","x":60,"y":2060,"width":120,"height":12,"strokeColor":"#ffec99","backgroundColor":"#ffec99","fillStyle":"solid","roughness":0},{"type":"text","id":"c_h","x":60,"y":2110,"text":"Atlas: AI that does the work,\nwhile you stay in control","fontSize":48},{"type":"text","id":"c_s","x":60,"y":2270,"text":"A team of AI assistants for your everyday business processes","fontSize":24},{"type":"text","id":"c_n","x":60,"y":2440,"text":"Client introduction  |  1 / 6","fontSize":16},{"type":"frame","id":"S1","name":"Slide 1. Introduction","x":0,"y":1960,"width":960,"height":540,"children":["c_bar","c_h","c_s","c_n"]},{"type":"text","id":"q_h","x":1080,"y":2000,"text":"Busy work slows your best people","fontSize":36},{"type":"text","id":"q_s","x":1080,"y":2056,"text":"Does any of this sound familiar?","fontSize":20},{"type":"rectangle","id":"q1","x":1080,"y":2130,